{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "从来不讨价还价  (Chun Yuqiao Never Bargains Over Casting)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Furious after the water-phobic replacement star suffers a meltdown at the pool, the agency head storms into Chun Yuqiao's office—only for Chun Yuqiao to play the hotel footage and name his non-negotiable price. Listen to the finale of Episode 14 first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，那边经纪公司的老板到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "叫他进来，你先去忙，从外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你把贾喆怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这只是一台机器拍的，另外还有两个机位。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮他，但是以他现在这个状况，恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "当然了，我也瞒不住你，你故意设计我们！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要的是荣思纶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，那边经纪公司的老板到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, the head of the partner agency has arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "叫他进来，你先去忙，从外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Send him in, go on with your work, and close the door from outside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你把贾喆怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you do to Jia Zhe?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这只是一台机器拍的，另外还有两个机位。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This clip is from just one camera—we have footage from two other angles as well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us keep the conversation civil, shall we?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮他，但是以他现在这个状况，恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have called a psychologist for him, yet in his current state he cannot work for now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His phobia of water is something your agency never should have hidden from us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "当然了，我也瞒不住你，你故意设计我们！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Clearly I could never hide anything from you—you set this trap for us on purpose!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要的是荣思纶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The star I want is Rong Silun.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As you ought to know very well, I never bargain.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，那边经纪公司的老板到了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "叫他进来，你先去忙，从外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你把贾喆怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这只是一台机器拍的，另外还有两个机位。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "体面点说话，行吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我已经找了心理医生帮他，但是以他现在这个状况，恐怕暂时没法工作了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他恐水这个事，你们经纪公司不应该瞒着我们。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "当然了，我也瞒不住你，你故意设计我们！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要的是荣思纶。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你应该清楚的，我从来不讨价还价。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With multi-camera proof in hand, Chun Yuqiao sweeps aside the unqualified replacement and reclaims his first-choice star for Charming Voyage. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
